<mxCell id="note1" value="An instance can also be &lt;b&gt;created&lt;/b&gt; already waived when its report was bypassed earlier (waiver inherited). waiver_reason records APPROVED_REPORTING_WAIVER, PIP_BYPASS or PIP_DECISION_PENDING." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa900;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="720" width="460" height="110" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note2" value="&lt;b&gt;Inferred – verify&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• No assignment of &lt;b&gt;cancelled&lt;/b&gt; was found.&lt;br&gt;• reconcile_suspension_obligations and _reconcile_preliminary_requested_report_instance reference pending and waived together; a waived → pending reversal after a PIP decision may exist – verify.&lt;br&gt;• Whether a missed instance can still become submitted_late was not traced." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cc0000;fontColor=#cc0000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="780" width="520" height="160" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
